% NOTE FOR THE ORCHESTRATOR — a misattribution found while resolving these:
% the chapter's "HDEHP/D2EHPA Systems" table carried ΔH_extr = −35 kJ/mol (La),
% −27 kJ/mol (Yb) and −36 kJ/mol (Am), attributed to nothing in particular and
% sitting under an HDEHP heading. Those four numbers are verbatim from
% `charbonnel2000thermodynamics` and are for DMDBTDMA, a malonamide DIAMIDE, by
% van't Hoff from 3 M HNO3 — not for HDEHP. The table has been relabelled and
